WEBVTT

00:14:29.949 --> 00:14:31.831
(In a deep voice) a British chauvinist,

00:14:31.855 --> 00:14:35.479
(In a high voice) and the other,
a high-pitched, coy British lady.

00:14:38.284 --> 00:14:40.704
Time stood still.

00:14:41.478 --> 00:14:43.010
Laughter,

00:14:43.034 --> 00:14:44.319
mimicry,

00:14:44.343 --> 00:14:46.081
joy, again,

00:14:46.105 --> 00:14:48.787
in the failure to understand gender.

00:14:49.843 --> 00:14:53.190
That's the potential
of gender rehearsativity.

00:14:54.588 --> 00:14:56.128
And I challenge you all

00:14:57.089 --> 00:14:59.822
to think of your days as mini-rehearsals.